# Hash64ReferenceVectors.json is the determinism pin (14 §8.0) and is re-asserted on the cross-platform
# job's live legs — Linux x64 and Android ARM64. (The iOS ARM64 leg is authored and gated off with iOS
# itself, `16` D34.) Its line endings are pinned to LF so the file is byte-identical on every one of
# them, and so a one-row addition never diffs as a whole-file rewrite because someone's core.autocrlf
# disagreed. It follows the same rule as game-data/.
*.json text eol=lf
